# Client data. This repository is PUBLIC.
#
# Three files in this folder carry the client's paid asset and other people's
# personal contact details. Checked on 2 September 2026:
#
#   Fieldwork-Accra-Delivery-Week2.xlsx   10 cells of live Ghanaian mobile and
#                                         WhatsApp numbers, plus the business
#                                         names they belong to. This is the
#                                         sheet the client bought.
#   exclusion-list.csv                    78 real business names, each tagged
#                                         with whether it was delivered. The
#                                         register that guarantees no repeats,
#                                         and a complete map of the product.
#   Fieldwork-outcome-tracker.xlsx        39 real business names. This one is
#                                         the trap: its shared strings table
#                                         reads like an empty template, and the
#                                         names are in the sheet data. Do not
#                                         clear this by opening it and glancing
#                                         at the first tab.
#
# Publishing any of them would hand away the thing the client paid for and
# disclose personal data covered by the Data Protection Act 2012. That is not
# Quadem's disclosure to make, and it stays true even if the client later
# agrees to be named.
#
# The redacted exhibits in jpg/ ARE published, on /services/fieldwork/. They
# were checked by eye first: names become trade labels, numbers keep their
# shape and lose their digits, handles are withheld, streets are cut back to
# the district.
#
# Anything new that lists businesses goes in here too, before it is written.

Fieldwork-Accra-Delivery-Week2.xlsx
exclusion-list.csv
Fieldwork-outcome-tracker.xlsx

